msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais ⟪k:1⟫vous ne pouvez⟪k:2⟫elle ne peut⟪k:3⟫ arrêter d’essayer."

#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 159a87e30d08b301fa318883e9a303f9ff9c57aa4192f7660ec3012ceb0e9d3e
