msgctxt "badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous repoussez⟪k:4⟫Elle repousse⟪k:5⟫ la main de la Servante.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Sous "
"ses yeux ébahis, ⟪k:8⟫vous vous précipitez⟪k:9⟫elle se précipite⟪k:10⟫ hors de la tour "
"d’observation."

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09f05a5660e7333a451469bb2a7b7e4309ab3525fe37c0878e5cdb1dbfd7e27d
#. default-sha256: 117aba868de772e39ff836d138fe7caa593300c6ff8015a7bba4da06692fbaee
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Down and down the spiral staircase ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ went, though not a whisper "
"of a footstep could be heard in the stone tower. ⟪k:6⟫The stairs seemed to go on forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous dévalez⟪k:4⟫Elle dévale⟪k:5⟫ les marches de l’escalier en spirale, et "
"pourtant aucun bruit de pas ne résonne dans la tour de pierre. ⟪k:6⟫L’escalier semble n’en plus "
"finir."

#: badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 495f9142c99d3e89ba74cf5fcd89568a8cd4bbef7f2ed57b864a6088aca55b92
