msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Enfin, ⟪k:3⟫vous arrivez⟪k:4⟫la Défunte arrive⟪k:5⟫ en bas et ⟪k:6⟫foncez⟪k:7⟫"
"fonce⟪k:8⟫ dans la pièce suivante sans même un regard pour l’ange du vitrail."

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 062250a5f43fc061a620e5264dd9564a82f0893d8ea47b4de1d3afd05a7eaa02
#. default-sha256: 7dbf712bab3131657149faa4fadfe7461cb2e2d39eceba07694182b4123ceff1
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫La Servante ⟪k:9⟫vous a⟪k:10⟫lui a⟪k:11⟫ fait "
"visiter le manoir, donc ⟪k:12⟫vous connaissez⟪k:13⟫elle connaît⟪k:14⟫ sa disposition."

#: badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d698eb8a6636ba6cac442baefd4980af300ab6354ba56e54d34d14727d224eb8
