msgid "⟪k:0⟫A large door came into view. ⟪k:1⟫The exit was up ahead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Une grande porte se dresse devant ⟪k:1⟫vous⟪k:2⟫elle⟪k:3⟫. ⟪k:4⟫Elle mène à la sortie."

#: badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a894ecf45daecbfd9abdd9998e4b8bd4cec56f3ba246c0236fcdaec99ec1edea
